        "content": "## Global Vendor KYB, SEC EDGAR, FDIC BankFind, EU VAT, EPA & Brazil CNPJ Waterfall (5-Actor Cascade)\n\nEnd-to-end corporate vendor onboarding & continuous KYB waterfall. Screens counterparties across US SEC EDGAR filings, US EPA environmental compliance, FDIC bank institutional health, EU VIES cross-border VAT validity, and Brazil Receita Federal CNPJ/QSA.\n\n### Multi-Actor Cascade Powered by Apify Store (`@b2b-quant-apis`):\n- [`b2b-quant-apis/us-sec-edgar-filings-insider-radar`](https://apify.com/b2b-quant-apis/us-sec-edgar-filings-insider-radar)\n- [`b2b-quant-apis/us-epa-echo-environmental-compliance-auditor`](https://apify.com/b2b-quant-apis/us-epa-echo-environmental-compliance-auditor)\n- [`b2b-quant-apis/us-fdic-bankfind-institution-financial-auditor`](https://apify.com/b2b-quant-apis/us-fdic-bankfind-institution-financial-auditor)\n- [`b2b-quant-apis/eu-vies-vat-tax-compliance-auditor`](https://apify.com/b2b-quant-apis/eu-vies-vat-tax-compliance-auditor)\n- [`b2b-quant-apis/brazil-b2b-cnpj-qsa-lead-enricher`](https://apify.com/b2b-quant-apis/brazil-b2b-cnpj-qsa-lead-enricher)\n\n**Setup:** Configure a single `httpHeaderAuth` credential (`Authorization: Bearer <YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN_HERE>`) across the Apify HTTP Request nodes and activate the Schedule Trigger.",
